<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 800)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Shared Review says when a share has no passphrase.</b> A share started with &#8220;Require the passphrase&#8221; off shows &#8220;No passphrase &#8212; this share&#8217;s link opens on its own&#8221; where the words would be, instead of nothing.</li>
<li>The Color menu no longer shows both &#8220;Review Grade Panel&#8221; and &#8220;Session Looks&#8221; (one per role; the menu&#8217;s rebuild on opening was undoing the pruning).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
